    "status": "ANSWERED",
    "answer": "In adults, lopinavir and ritonavir can be given in a once daily or twice daily dosing regimen. The recommended once daily dosage regimen is 800 mg/200 mg (10 mL) once daily. The recommended twice daily dosage regimen is 400 mg/100 mg (5 mL) twice daily. The oral solution must be taken with food.",
